# ==============================================================================
# Rule Name: YouTube (Custom)
# Description: YouTube streaming services service endpoints
# Scope: YouTube web, app, video streams, thumbnails, and short links
# Architectural Boundary:
#   - Isolated from Google.lsr so YouTube media streams do not route to general Google egress
# ==============================================================================

# Target: Core YouTube video streaming and web assets
# Evidence: YouTube web and iOS client streaming telemetry, 2026-09-28
# Reason: Baseline anchors; mature upstream provides comprehensive 180+ streaming and CDN rules
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,youtube.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ytimg.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,googlevideo.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,youtu.be
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,youtube-nocookie.com
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,youtube
